      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a really good start, it feels very elegant.\n\nthough, i just ran it through the tool and the richness score was actually kind of low—it's sitting at around 15 unique adjectives. the creative director is really pushing for a more \"expansive\" feel for this collection, and they want the automated score to be much higher to justify the premium positioning.\n\ncan you try another version? try to elevate the prose and weave in even more descriptive, sophisticated adjectives to boost that score, but keep that same seamless flow you had before. remember, it shouldn't feel like you're just listing words, it just needs to feel deeper and more \"rich\".",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
