      "content": "thanks, that's definitely more substantial. i see the score bumped up a bit, but it's still not quite where we need it to be to clear the threshold for the premium tier. it's hovering around 25-30 unique adjectives now.\n\nthe director is being really specific—they want the prose to feel \"maximalist\" and \"overflowing with sensory detail.\" they want the reader to feel absolutely overwhelmed by the sheer depth of the scent's character. \n\ncan you push it further? i need you to really lean into those descriptive layers. try to find even more unique, complex adjectives to weave into every sentence to really drive that richness score up. just please, try to keep the luxury vibe alive—don't let it become a list, keep it flowing like the last one, but much more \"dense\" with description.",
